{
  "_comment": [
    "The shared fixture for „play it out\" — docs/PLAN-DOMACI-ZADATAK.md §3, phase 2.",
    "Two ends have to agree about when an assigned game is over and whether the goal",
    "was met: the app decides it on the board, to stop the game and say what happened,",
    "and the server decides it again when the result is recorded, because no answer in",
    "this app is marked by the client. When two ends must agree, they share one fixture",
    "(CLAUDE.md rule 12) — this file. The backend reads it in",
    "chess_backend/test/engine_game_task.test.js, the app in",
    "chess_app/test/engine_game_goal_test.dart.",
    "moves are SAN from the task's fen. ownMoves counts the student's own moves.",
    "Endings: checkmate, stalemate, insufficientMaterial, threefoldRepetition,",
    "fiftyMoves, moveLimit, moveTarget, resignation. outcome: won, lost, drawn, undecided."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "win met: the student mates",
      "task": { "fen": "6k1/5ppp/8/8/8/8/5PPP/3R2K1 w - - 0 1", "side": "w", "goal": "win", "plyCap": 40 },
      "moves": ["Rd8#"],
      "expect": { "ending": "checkmate", "outcome": "won", "goalMet": true, "ownMoves": 1 }
    },
    {
      "name": "win missed: the student is mated",
      "task": { "fen": "6k1/5ppp/p7/8/8/8/5PPP/3R2K1 b - - 0 1", "side": "b", "goal": "win", "plyCap": 40 },
      "moves": ["a5", "Rd8#"],
      "expect": { "ending": "checkmate", "outcome": "lost", "goalMet": false, "ownMoves": 1 }
    },
    {
      "name": "win missed: a draw is not a win",
